  "question": {
    "text": "If the order of the differential equation of the family of circles touching the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at the origin is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
